exports[`repro815: board independence before and after KiCad export 1`] = `
"Issue #815: separate boards must not need connections to each other.
KiCad merges nets with the same name, even if their numeric IDs differ.

CIRCUIT JSON INPUT
Boards: 9
Independent R1.pin2 -> C1.pin1 connections: 9
Each connection is already routed within its own board.

EXPORTED KICAD NETS
Numeric ID | Net name
1 | .R1 > .pin2 to .C1 > .pin1
2 | .R1 > .pin2 to .C1 > .pin1
3 | .R1 > .pin2 to .C1 > .pin1
4 | .R1 > .pin2 to .C1 > .pin1
5 | .R1 > .pin2 to .C1 > .pin1
6 | .R1 > .pin2 to .C1 > .pin1
7 | .R1 > .pin2 to .C1 > .pin1
8 | .R1 > .pin2 to .C1 > .pin1
9 | .R1 > .pin2 to .C1 > .pin1

EXPECTED VS ACTUAL
Unique net names: expected 9, actual 1
Native KiCad DRC missing connections: expected 0, actual 8

BUG: KiCad requests connections between boards that should be independent."
`;
